{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_bryota_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_bryota_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"風情街的日與夜","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bryota_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"1b867275a797f2ecab0ce6d776ffb949d8eab6b11aa265e4f68af3a0acd44e3d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"與火山“告別”的日子已經過去兩個星期了，親愛的汐斯塔居民們，你們還在想念著火山噴發時的奇景嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道在那個瞬間，你們心裡都想著什麼？畢竟是此生唯一的時刻——噢，但願它是此生唯一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“太好了，我還活著！”“就這樣？結束了？”......還是“再見，我們以前的汐斯塔！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，在那時我滿腦子都想著伸手從天上揪一塊火山雲下來，嚐嚐那到底是番茄味還是草莓味的“棉花糖”！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快要好了哦，想加點什麼？草莓醬還是番茄醬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要加棉花糖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有這種吃法。喏，路特船長，拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我不是船長，是上校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的路特上校，希望草莓醬合你的口味。麗芙要什麼醬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗芙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你也要嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是埃尼斯只煎了這麼多，如果你也要，可就沒有哈莉的份了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要不，我的分你一半，好不好？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（麗芙她......在和空氣對話？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（該不會是在說夢話吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞌睡蟲。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（還是切成兩半好了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗芙，這是你的。一半草莓醬，一半番茄醬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！這不公平！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，路特上校也有番茄醬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，現在是益智競猜時間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果埃尼斯和哈莉都不在家，你們自己弄完飯，第一件要做的事是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關火——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這太簡單了，前天你剛出過這道題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗芙的答案是什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，麗芙——不要剛吃一口就往外跑，麗芙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼突然就跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（麗芙她今天一直怪怪的......該不會是因為我要走了，不開心，所以才心不在焉的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（果然還是要找她好好談一談。臨走前帶她去寵物店逛逛吧，看看有沒有願意陪陪她的小動物。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇！我的煎蛋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！剛剛才說過，弄完飯要關火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......別學我啊，這是個錯誤的示範。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一個飯沒吃完就出去亂跑，另一個又弄糊了自己的早餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而乖乖坐在餐桌邊，很聽話地吃早飯的路特上校，卻得不到像樣的獎勵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什麼獎勵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個“D32鋼戰士”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我倒是想到一個不錯的獎勵。比如，讓我忘記你用我的唇膏在酒水單上亂塗亂畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是我做的，哈莉！或者我把要求降低一點，請埃尼斯再給我一個煎蛋，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"討價還價的孩子，要扣掉一個獎勵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那我也要走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特，今天又要去哪裡玩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——告——訴——你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，加了胡椒粉，和以前一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是把鍋裡那個煎過了火的“可憐蛋”給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，還不算太糊......我吃就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（伸手拿杯子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，路特！那個是......別喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈莉！不是說過了，不要把喝剩下的酒隨便放在吧台上，路特他們可還沒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，年輕人，一點點橘子酒罷了，不要那麼緊張。最近幾天，你可比我更像他們的老媽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“大日子”來臨前，不能鬆弛應對的人，可成不了環遊各地的探險家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是兩碼事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即將開始演奏的樂手可沒時間擔心旁人有沒有上好弦。與其操心我們，不如想想你自己的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過幾天就要走了，打工的地方都交接完畢了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三，二，一，唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎哎，你慢著點......我抵住這邊了，用力，抬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用力——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好了，這應該就是最後一箱了。終端上顯示還有一批沒送到汐斯塔的貨品，等它們抵達後，就拜託你幫忙送到庫房，仔細盤點嘍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"是峯聯貿易的訂單，你就放心吧。有錢拿，我自然不會怠慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不過最近的加急貨件一批接著一批，又少了你來分擔工作，看來今天我又得送到晚上囉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，埃尼斯，你真的下定決心，要離開汐斯塔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，已經決定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒想到......這下振興汐斯塔旅遊業的道路上，又少了一員幹將啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"來，擁抱一下吧，祝你一路順風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛這麼鄭重，搞得像我再也不回來了一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，一個幾乎天天碰面的好友忽然就要走了，肯定會捨不得的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"想來你的家人更不好受，畢竟你們朝夕相處。風情街改建的事剛塵埃落定，卻又要面臨分別，實在是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈莉她倒是接受得蠻快的，她年輕時就到處跑，估計早就想讓我也出去闖闖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於弟弟妹妹，可能確實還需要一點時間吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天我也一直在想，我能給他們留下點什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，埃尼斯，那個走在路上自言自語的，是不是你妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她......有點奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先跟過去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"塔吊伸展著長臂，吊繩緩緩劃過天空中綿綿的雲。像是一個熟練的甜點師，在聚精會神地抹平蛋糕上的奶霜。\n遠處的汐斯塔火山間斷著冒出灰白的煙。自從兩周前大發脾氣後，它就一直這樣氣喘吁吁的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一半抹了草莓醬的煎蛋，是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"湯姆爺爺今天沒有開店，所以就沒辦法給你買冰淇淋啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這個草莓醬也很好吃哦，是埃尼斯自己做的。埃尼斯他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗芙她......怎麼又來未建成地塊了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火山爆發時，她也是獨自一個人跑來這裡......難道說是那天的海嘯，讓她留下心理陰影了？不，那她應該更不敢來才對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡更近，差不多能聽得清楚一點。但願別被她發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？她身邊好像有一個......毛絨絨的生物？原來麗芙之前一直是在和它說話嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（進食）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是埃尼斯送給我的小土偶。卷卷的頭髮，耳邊還有朵小花，你覺得它像我嗎？埃尼斯說，這是他用魔法變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯是個騙子，他根本不會魔法。故事裡的魔術師可都是神通廣大，從來不會生病的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不滿地哼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你想告訴我，其實魔術師也是會生病的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我寧願埃尼斯不是魔術師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望他沒得“石頭病”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低落地哼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生姐姐說，埃尼斯的病，還不算太嚴重。可是那一回，他卻一連在醫院裡睡了整整三天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前，風情街的大人們也說過，如果得了“石頭病”，最後就會變成石頭。不能動，也不能說話，風一吹就會散成細細的沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不想埃尼斯變成那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（靠近蹭蹭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近幾天，埃尼斯一直怪怪的，看起來很緊張，會不會也是“石頭病”導致的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，馬上埃尼斯就要走了，他要上一艘名叫羅德島的船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（疑惑地哼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......捨不得，我當然捨不得埃尼斯呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，哈莉說那艘船上有好多好多厲害的醫生，他們一定會把埃尼斯的“石頭病”治好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要埃尼斯能恢復健康，那就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於風情街這裡......還有哈莉和你陪著我不是嗎？哦，對了，還有討厭的路特。我們可以一起等著埃尼斯回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我還以為她是不捨得我離開，原來麗芙是因為擔心我的病情，才一直悶悶不樂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不應該啊埃尼斯，讓妹妹這樣擔心你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轉頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個毛絨絨的......注意到我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，好像在海嘯襲來那時，我也見到了一模一樣的生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來那都不是夢啊......就是它們保護了我和麗芙，保護了汐斯塔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗芙也交到了“新朋友”啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......湯姆爺爺發來的短訊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"湯姆爺爺！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"湯姆爺爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噓！小聲點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在這，遮陽棚上，抬頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您這又是在做什麼？短訊裡那麼急著讓我過來，一連打了好幾個驚嘆號......您這店今天又沒開門，我還以為您出了啥大事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"亂想什麼呢，臭小子！我的身子骨還沒那麼糟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了，快點上來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？上去幹什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這倔小子，上來你就知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，遮陽棚上有什麼好東西嗎？可別告訴我，您只是想邀請我共賞汐斯塔午後的太陽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那個小孩子是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特？他站在樂器店門口幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打工。最近一段時間總能見到他，看上去像是在幫忙招攬顧客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打工？他打什麼工......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣想來，路特這幾天確實總是不見人影。每次問他去做什麼，總是支支吾吾地不願說，弄得怪神秘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是因為零用錢不夠了？該不會就是為了買那個“D32鋼戰士”吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，你這個當哥哥的，老把他們當成小不點看護著怎麼行，要多關注他們的成長啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的......成長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。路特那小子，看樣子是開始對樂器感興趣了。不愧是在風情街長大的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樂器店老闆和我提起過，路特向他打聽吉他的價格，想學吉他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來哈莉那幾個不輕易示人的吉他技巧，總算是有人繼承咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他現在也太小了......就算他真想買，也可以找我要錢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找樂器店老闆問問去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，笨小子，你可別掃興了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當哥哥的總是那麼自大，總是想為弟弟妹妹包辦一切，覺得他們永遠離不開自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看啊，是你離不開他們吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......我們一直是這樣相處的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是因為我要離開了，我才要把我能為他們做的，都做到最好。只是一把吉他而已，我可以給他買。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你能買，難道你還能教？就算你能教，難道你還能替他練習？乾脆你去幫他實現音樂夢想得了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仔細想想，麗芙有陪伴她的“新朋友”，路特也開始有想做的事了......好像他們確實不再像以前一樣需要我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忽然感覺，好殘酷啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你再捨不得這兩個小跟屁蟲，時間是公平的，他們總會長大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遲早有一天，他們會為自己的人生做決定，就像你如今決定離開汐斯塔一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也不想缺席他們的成長啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看路特那一板一眼地給遊客介紹商品的樣子，是不是很像一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像在舊汐斯塔海灘上，到處向遊客推銷瓶裝汽水的小埃尼斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然未來的日子裡，你無法陪在弟弟妹妹身邊。但是在你們相處的時間裡，你早就在潛移默化之中，影響了他們的行為與想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在“純白火山”的回憶，會替你陪著他們長大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的......回憶......“純白火山”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像有點明白......為什麼哈莉之前那麼反對拆掉“純白火山”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，小時候的你還是要比路特精明得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟你可是會把沙灘烤肉鋪的調料偷偷換成變態辣，然後守在旁邊若無其事地賣冰汽水的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前的事您竟然還記得啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是誰嚐一口那無比“火辣”的烤肉，都會永生難忘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想著快點幫店裡把飲料都賣完嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣就可以早點收工，哈莉就能騰出時間來，和樂隊老友們練上幾首新寫的曲子，而我也能陪路特和麗芙去海裡游上幾圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，那個時候路特和麗芙才剛來到家裡沒多久，一雙小手連浮球都抱不住，只能把浮板綁在後背上，抓著我的胳膊，在淺水裡撲騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一轉眼他們就......時間過得可真快啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都是，我們一家人的回憶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，湯姆爺爺！我要去水上樂園的工地一趟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道臨走前我要留下些什麼了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人，精力真是旺盛啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你剛來到汐斯塔的時候，也和埃尼斯一樣，像是有永遠用不完的精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才，我講得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"冰品店的門把手輕輕旋動，一直緊閉的店門緩緩打開。\n女人從店裡走了出來，望著遮陽棚上，正悠閒地曬太陽的老店主。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有水準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是比風情街還要年長的湯姆叔叔。還有什麼家庭問題是您無法解決的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜你給的提綱所賜，我難得過了一把嘴癮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過既然你想得這麼清楚，何不自己去跟埃尼斯講，非要借我這個外人之口來“打邊鼓”呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，和查克分別時倒是很痛快，照樣喝照樣唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"輪到兒子要離開時，果真是不一樣咯，到底是做母親的......或許應該讓到處瘋玩的查克跟你換換。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還不願意和他換勒！從成為他們母親的那一刻起，我就做不來旅行家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我欠您一杯好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓我嚐嚐你新創的“棉花落日”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加一點變態辣辣椒粉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正合我意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"narration","text":"叮，叮。\n咣，咣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的門牌，應該是這樣的。唔，尺寸好像不太對，這裡還得弄短一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這個木材太軟了，還是得用石料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......工地那邊帶來的石頭，好像還有一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一塊還不錯。好，在他們回來之前，趕緊弄完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經迫不及待想看到他們吃驚的樣子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......怎麼又流鼻血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是因為我現在充滿幹勁，熱血沸騰吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？哈、哈莉？！你怎麼這麼早......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些石頭，土塊......你小子，又在偷偷練習源石技藝？醫生的話都當耳邊風了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是啊！你聽我解釋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（擦鼻血）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。刻刀，錘子，弓鋸......這些都是我親手做的！不是用源石技藝做的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還看不太出來吧？只要把這個“屋頂”放上來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏘鏘！歡迎回到，最初的“純白火山”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，這個模型逼真吧？每個部件都是我一點點做的！你看這個指示牌，是不是和舊風情街的一模一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我的雕工不太行......這個小冰箱的把手就做得有點歪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這就是你臨走前要留給我們的“驚喜”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是我的個人作品哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在它還不算是完全體，還差幾個最最重要的小部件。剩下的部分，需要我們一家人，一起完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"土偶？這是我？怎麼是爆炸頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來是有辮子的，被我不小心刻斷了，只好改成爆炸頭了......在我小時候，你就是這樣蓬鬆的髮型，不是嗎？我還一直覺得挺酷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，最早的“純白火山”可不是這樣的。這些沙灘椅、充氣船，都是擴建之後才有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準確地說，這些都是有了麗芙和路特以後才有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從那時起，才是完整的“純白火山”，是“我們的回憶”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特&麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"超小的“純白火山”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哥哥做的“純白火山”模型，怎麼樣，是不是很厲害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站在超小“純白火山”門前的是......哈莉和埃尼斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是小土偶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，沒錯！探險隊的隊員們，你們的小土偶呢？也一起放進來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有兩個新朋友——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......土偶小毛羊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......土偶“D32鋼戰士”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，這不是“D32鋼戰士”，是“固源岩少校”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它看見了小小年紀就在樂器店打工的路特上校，深受鼓舞，所以就來追隨我們啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（埃尼斯怎麼知道的？是不是你偷偷說啦！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我......我可沒有！一定是你太笨，所以才露餡啦！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，總、總而言之！“固源岩少校”和我一樣，都很期待路特上校買到他心儀的吉他，開啟他的音樂之路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特，在我下次回來之前，你可要從哈莉那裡多學來幾首曲子啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我可沒同意教他啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼吉他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你去樂器店幫忙，不是為了買吉他嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特，埃尼斯好像比你還笨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是告訴他吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小男孩聳了聳肩，從小背包裡拿出了一個小木盒子，交到埃尼斯的手中。\n光滑的鐵片整齊地排列，末端組成一條漂亮的弧線，看上去如同大海獻給沙灘的一簇浪花。\n木盒子的表面上用彩筆畫著“純白火山”的標誌，粉粉的小毛羊貼在標誌旁，好像要把它一口吃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......拇指琴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送給我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這是我和樂器店老闆“交易”來的。上面的圖案是麗芙畫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抱住）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！埃尼斯！太緊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特......麗芙......謝謝你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來路特和麗芙都很瞭解你，知道你是個勉強只會彈拇指琴的“樂器笨蛋”啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈莉，這個時候就請不要破壞氣氛啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，大功告成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來把這個“純白火山”模型放在店門口還挺合適的，像個吉祥物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等水上樂園建好後，會不會有遊客來問，這個小房子是什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與其期待有客人欣賞你的傑作，不如祈禱不要有醉鬼吐在上面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈莉，我相信你會阻止這種事情發生的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟在之後的很長一段時間裡，我只能以生活在“純白火山”模型裡的小土偶的形式，陪在你們身邊啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，照顧好自己比什麼都重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你不覺得這個模型裡少了些什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......天啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘了把“查克”也放進去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！有你的加急包裹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"謝天謝地，最後一件是寄給你的。不然我可真要詛咒我這繁忙又枯燥的一天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加急包裹？是誰寄來的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發件人是......查、查克？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少年略帶期待地打開了這個從遠方寄來的紙盒子。\n層層的舊報紙包裹著的，是一個由乾藤編成的小草人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個草人，好像長得有點像查克啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，它的背包......是紙疊成的？裡面好像有字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“兒子，聽說你要離開「純白火山」了？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“替我告訴哈莉，我在我們的家庭銀行帳戶裡留下了一點「金喜」。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有他的風格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望他帶來的是路特和麗芙下個學期的住宿費，而不是一份債務通知單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“草人是我在玻利瓦爾時，當地人教我編的。是不是和我一樣強壯？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽有一陣風吹來，草人的手腳像藤條一樣晃蕩起來。\n樹葉做成的帽子也被吹飛了，露出草人禿禿的頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“就讓它代替我，為你送行吧！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“外出旅行可不是簡單的事。你已經規劃好航線了嗎？旅程的終點又在哪裡？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“在我們相聚之前，我期待著你的答案。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾個熟客掀起了門簾，母親招呼著他們坐下，冰塊在搖酒壺中舞蹈。\n弟弟妹妹的歡笑聲也傳入耳中，恍惚中，他像是回到了那片沙灘，回到了那間兒時的小店。\n少年望向風情街的盡頭，不覺間，落日的餘暉已為尋常的夜，謄寫好了樂譜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於，要出發了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未來，會是什麼樣的呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
